  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining  Expansion of the Overseas Health Assessment and Management of the United States Bound Migrants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the overall IOM&#x2019;s work with CDC on sustaining the Expansion of the Overseas Health Assessment and Management of United States Bound Migrants, aiming to enhance global health security and preparedness. In coordination with partners, IOM plans to strengthen prevention and control of infectious diseases, develop training and tools and enhance health education to improve the health of migrants and their host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
